From 810b6f45175d69658b5360555ccf753984e43a2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 12:54:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 03985/11362] [outer-loop] exp4729: checkpoint/resume + soft
 wall-clock budget so the held-out SCORE survives codex's 4800s cap

exp4729 (held-out first-win readiness SCORE) deterministically exceeded codex's 4800s hard
wall-clock cap and FAILed every milestone (3x on .435) producing no artifact. Fix (delegated to a
sub-agent, independently re-verified here): checkpoint/resume WITHOUT changing what is measured.

- run_held_out_proxy_checkpointed() is the new default proxy runner: drives exp4605's per-game
  building blocks, checkpoints the attempt ledger after EACH game (atomic temp + os.replace), and on
  startup skips games already in the ledger. SCORE (first-win rate, CI, deepen/solve rate, verdict)
  is computed by the SAME exp4605 aggregation on the SAME rows in the SAME
  sorted(games) x sorted(variant_ids) order -> byte-identical to a single uncapped run.
- Soft ELAPSED-time budget (EXP4729_SOFT_BUDGET_S, default 4200s, ~600s under the hard cap): between
  games, if now()-started >= budget, raise _BudgetExceeded -> run() writes a schema-valid
  `partial: true` artifact (completed/remaining variants + terminal-prefix verdict) and exits 0
  cleanly, KEEPING the ledger so the next run resumes. On full completion: `partial: false`, checksum
  re-stamped, ledger cleared, final artifact identical in SCORE to today's full run.
- Schema: a `partial: true` artifact is exempted from the >=100-variant-attempt floor (identity-tight
  `is True`, so a non-partial buggy artifact is still flagged).

INDEPENDENTLY VERIFIED (re-ran, not just trusting the agent): parse + import OK; 9 new tests
(tests/python/test_experiment_4729_checkpoint_resume.py, incl. a full-run==resumed-run SCORE-equivalence
test + an elapsed-not-absolute-clock regression guard + atomic-write + corruption-defensive load) and
11 original 4729 tests pass (20 total); ruff clean. Addresses ops/known-issues.md 2026-06-25
INFRASTRUCTURE entry. operator can override the budget via EXP4729_SOFT_BUDGET_S.

